  "body": "\"Verify the application never reveals session tokens **as GET parameters** in URLs or error messages.\" - no point to limit this to GET requests, same issue applies to POST and other verbs too - in short the URL should not contain the session id (regardless of HTTP verb or whether as query parameter or path parameter)",
